# Modelling Notebook

This folder contains the Jupyter Notebook code developed for the master thesis project:

**Hybrid SARIMAX–XGBoost Forecasting for E-commerce Profit Margin Prediction**

The notebook includes data preprocessing, profit margin calculation, exploratory data analysis, feature engineering, SARIMAX modelling, XGBoost residual learning, hybrid forecasting, model evaluation, and category-level performance analysis.

## Main Notebook

The main notebook file should be added here:

sarimax_xgboost_profit_margin_forecasting.ipynb
